{"sha": "c5c9a77df699d582ef60d76ed595407e47b8a086e3058add26561ad29e26cb03", "body": ["\\section{弛豫}", "", "\\begin{definition}[纵向与横向弛豫时间]\\label{def:b3:advanced-nmr:relaxation}", "扰动之后 $M_z$ 回到 $M_0$ 呈指数规律，特征时间为", "\\emph{纵向弛豫时间}\\index{纵向弛豫时间} $T_1$（自旋–晶格弛豫：能量传给外界）。", "横向磁化强度衰减到零同样呈指数规律，", "特征时间为", "\\emph{横向弛豫时间}\\index{横向弛豫时间} $T_2 \\le T_1$", "（自旋–自旋弛豫：自旋之间相位相干性的丧失）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[反转恢复]\\label{prop:b3:advanced-nmr:inversion-recovery}", "施加 $180^\\circ$ 脉冲后，$M_z(t) = M_0(1 - 2\\eu^{-t/T_1})$，它在", "$t_{\\mathrm{null}} = T_1\\ln2$ 处经过零点。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由弛豫方程 $\\dd M_z/\\dd t = (M_0 - M_z)/T_1$，初值 $M_z(0) = -M_0$，", "解得 $M_0 - 2M_0\\eu^{-t/T_1}$，当 $\\eu^{-t/T_1} = \\frac12$ 时该式为零。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[测量 $T_1$ 并设定定量循环延迟]\\label{met:b3:advanced-nmr:t1}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 对一系列延迟运行脉冲序列 $180^\\circ$--$\\tau$--$90^\\circ$--采集，", "        其中 $\\tau$ 取一系列值，每两次扫描之间至少等待 $5T_1$。", "  \\item 将每个信号拟合为 $M_0(1 - 2\\eu^{-\\tau/T_1})$，或读取零点，由此得 $T_1 =", "        t_{\\mathrm{null}}/\\ln2$。", "  \\item 若用 $90^\\circ$ 脉冲进行定量积分，两次扫描之间须至少等待弛豫最慢原子核的", "        $5T_1$，此时缺失的磁化强度占比 $\\eu^{-5} < 1\\,\\%$，", "        可以忽略。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.62\\linewidth, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=-1.1, ymax=1.15,", "  axis lines=left, xlabel={$t$ / s}, ylabel={$M/M_0$}, legend cell align=left,", "  legend style={font=\\small, draw=none, at={(0.97,0.05)}, anchor=south east},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=t, y=mz] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-nmr-relaxation.dat};", "\\addlegendentry{$M_z$ 经 $180^\\circ$ 脉冲后（$T_1 = \\qty{2.0}{s}$）}", "\\addplot[omThm, thick, dashed] table[x=t, y=mxy] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-nmr-relaxation.dat};", "\\addlegendentry{$M_{xy}$ 经 $90^\\circ$ 脉冲后（$T_2 = \\qty{0.5}{s}$）}", "\\addplot[gray, dotted, domain=0:10] {0};", "\\addplot[only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.5pt, black] coordinates {(1.386,0)};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:1.5,-0.04) {$T_1\\ln2$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 弛豫（模型值）。反转后的纵向磁化强度", "在 $T_1\\ln2$ 处恢复过零点；横向磁化强度", "衰减更快，由 $T_2$ 决定。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[自旋回波]\\label{def:b3:advanced-nmr:echo}", "在脉冲序列 $90^\\circ$--$\\tau$--$180^\\circ$--$\\tau$ 中，", "因磁场不均匀而相位散开的自旋在时刻 $2\\tau$ 重新聚焦，形成", "\\emph{自旋回波}\\index{自旋回波}；其幅度按真实的 $T_2$ 衰减，", "不受磁体不均匀性的影响。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[核欧沃豪斯效应]\\label{def:b3:advanced-nmr:noe}", "对一个自旋进行饱和或扰动，通过二者之间的偶极弛豫，", "改变空间上邻近的另一自旋信号的强度，", "即\\emph{核欧沃豪斯效应}\\index{核欧沃豪斯效应}（NOE）。", "其增长速率与 $r^{-6}$ 成正比，因此只有在", "相距约 \\qty{0.5}{nm} 以内的原子核之间才能观察到，无论是否成键。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\section{二维核磁共振}", "", "\\begin{definition}[二维谱、交叉峰、对角峰]\\label{def:b3:advanced-nmr:two-d}", "\\emph{二维谱}\\index{二维谱}通过重复一个脉冲序列记录，", "该序列在采集时间之前带有递增的延迟 $t_1$，", "采集时间为 $t_2$；经二重傅里叶变换，得到强度随两个频率变化的图谱。", "\\emph{交叉峰}\\index{交叉峰}位于 $(\\delta_1,", "\\delta_2)$ 表明 $\\delta_1$ 与 $\\delta_2$ 处的原子核相连（通过耦合或", "邻近关系）；\\emph{对角峰}\\index{对角峰}位于 $(\\delta, \\delta)$，", "对应单个原子核。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[COSY, HSQC, HMBC, NOESY]\\label{def:b3:advanced-nmr:experiments}", "\\emph{COSY}\\index{COSY}（相关谱）使相互耦合的质子相关联，", "通常经三个键（H--C--C--H）相连。\\emph{HSQC}\\index{HSQC}", "（异核单量子相干）使每个碳与", "其直接相连的质子相关联。\\emph{HMBC}\\index{HMBC}（异核", "多键相关）使碳与相隔两个或三个键的质子相关，", "并跨越季碳和杂原子。\\emph{NOESY}\\index{NOESY}", "使空间上相近的质子通过核欧沃豪斯效应相关联。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\foreach \\y/\\name in {3.2/{one pulse}, 2.0/{inversion recovery}, 0.8/{spin echo}, -0.4/{COSY}}{", "    \\draw (0,\\y) -- (9.3,\\y); \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.1,\\y+0.25) {\\name};}", "  % one pulse", "  \\fill[black] (0.4,3.2) rectangle (0.6,3.75);", "  \\draw[omDef, domain=0:3.5, samples=120] plot (0.7+\\x, {3.2+0.4*exp(-\\x/1.2)*sin(\\x*500)});", "  % inversion recovery", "  \\fill[black] (0.4,2.0) rectangle (0.8,2.55); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0.6,2.7) {180};", "  \\draw[<->] (0.85,1.85) -- (2.4,1.85) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$\\tau$};", "  \\fill[black] (2.45,2.0) rectangle (2.65,2.55); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (2.55,2.7) {90};", "  \\draw[omDef, domain=0:3.0, samples=120] plot (2.75+\\x, {2.0+0.4*exp(-\\x/1.0)*sin(\\x*500)});", "  % spin echo", "  \\fill[black] (0.4,0.8) rectangle (0.6,1.35); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0.5,1.5) {90};", "  \\draw[<->] (0.65,0.65) -- (2.4,0.65) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$\\tau$};", "  \\fill[black] (2.45,0.8) rectangle (2.85,1.35); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (2.65,1.5) {180};", "  \\draw[<->] (2.9,0.65) -- (4.65,0.65) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$\\tau$};", "  \\draw[omDef, domain=-1.2:2.5, samples=150] plot (4.65+\\x, {0.8+0.35*exp(-abs(\\x)/0.35)*cos(\\x*700)});", "  % COSY", "  \\fill[black] (0.4,-0.4) rectangle (0.6,0.15); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0.5,0.3) {90};", "  \\draw[<->] (0.65,-0.55) -- (2.4,-0.55) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$t_1$（递增）};", "  \\fill[black] (2.45,-0.4) rectangle (2.65,0.15); \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (2.55,0.3) {90};", "  \\draw[omDef, domain=0:3.0, samples=120] plot (2.75+\\x, {-0.4+0.4*exp(-\\x/1.0)*sin(\\x*500)});", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (5.9,-0.2) {采集（$t_2$）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}